    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39095" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōstĭtūtor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A prostitutor</i>, <i>pander</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Cult. Fem.
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In gen., <i>one who dishonors</i>, <i>a
				violator</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Christiani sacramenti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Pudic. 10</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Cult. Fem. 2, 10</span></i>.</div>
